    "detailed_description": "Eureka is an open-world business management simulator. Start with a small crew and some basic supplies and turn your empty planet into a bustling beacon of industry.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose Your Products</h2>Turn raw resources into any product you choose. Mine and refine gold. Turn trees into chairs. Cultivate crops. What you sell is up to you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage Your Employees</h2>Plan out construction, mining, manufacturing, and more, then assign workers to get it done. Efficiency is key.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play the Market</h2>Buy and sell goods from space-faring merchant ships while keeping an eye on the fluctuating galactic market. A shift in the economy might require a rethink of your business strategy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Profit</h2>Manage your crew efficiently, sell the right products at the right times, and make your millions!",
    "about_the_game": "Eureka is an open-world business management simulator. Start with a small crew and some basic supplies and turn your empty planet into a bustling beacon of industry.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose Your Products</h2>Turn raw resources into any product you choose. Mine and refine gold. Turn trees into chairs. Cultivate crops. What you sell is up to you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage Your Employees</h2>Plan out construction, mining, manufacturing, and more, then assign workers to get it done. Efficiency is key.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play the Market</h2>Buy and sell goods from space-faring merchant ships while keeping an eye on the fluctuating galactic market. A shift in the economy might require a rethink of your business strategy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Profit</h2>Manage your crew efficiently, sell the right products at the right times, and make your millions!",
    "short_description": "Eureka is an open-world business management simulator. From gold mining to wheat farming, choose your products, manage your resources, and grow your business however you see fit!",
